      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "By the product rule and the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = - 8 x^{2} \\left(7 - 2 x^{2}\\right) + \\left(7 - 2 x^{2}\\right)^{2} \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99023",
         "rule_named": "product rule with the chain rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "At x = 1 the inner value is 5 and the inner derivative is -4, so \\( h'(1) = 25 + 1 \\cdot 10 \\cdot \\left(-4\\right) = -15 \\).",
